@DMS.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{DMS.API_HostAddress}}/health

### Create a collection
POST {{DMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invoices",
  "description": "All incoming invoices"
}

### List collections
GET {{DMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/collections

### Create a tag
POST {{DMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "important"
}

### List tags
GET {{DMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/tags

### Upload a document (multipart/form-data)
POST {{DMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----dms

------dms
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello from DMS!
------dms
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Example document
------dms--